Progress/Status: Following the commissioning of the McKenzie desalination plant on 14 April 2025, the desalination production capacity has increased from 200m3/d to 2,500m3/d. Commissioning of the Betio desalination plant (total production capacity
(3,500m3/day) is delayed due to unforeseen high concentrations of hydrogen sulfide in the source water.
Options to address the issue are currently being investigated. 
Data Source: PUB/DBO reports 
